    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Based on the summary of the effective indicators of winning the game, the coach is advised to strengthen the cooperation training of three-member groups, improve the passing quality according to the opponent's Control opening attack routine and pay attention to the player's physical and skill training in order to achieve a better performance in the future."
  },
  {
