    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "For the fourth problem, our findings are summarized from the perspective of model indicators pi1, tp2, tp3 and tp4. In the design of a generalized model the factors to be considered are frequent and close interaction, affecting all aspects of the task for division of labor, being gradual, full interaction or communication within a subgroup. Others include collective consciousness, the cores and team trust."
  },
